      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Parcel of Land for Sale Portnoo, Co. Donegal\n\nCampbells Auctioneers are pleased to present this attractive parcel of land to the market, ideally located in Portnoo, just a short drive from Narin Village.\n\nExtending to approximately 2.12 acres, the property occupies a peaceful and scenic setting and benefits from ample road frontage.\n\nThe lands are being offered for sale as is, in their current condition, providing an opportunity to acquire a substantial parcel of land in this highly desirable area of Donegal.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, please contact Campbells Auctioneers.\n\nOur Ref: K1321"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
